The entry after a first-block plus description is its sibling

```
> :: t
> : +
> > q
> : b
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
    </dd>
    <dd>b</dd>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```

```
:: t
: +
after
:: u
: w
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>after</dd>
  <dt>u</dt>
  <dd>w</dd>
</dl>
```
